O<probe_circle_outside> sub
(Call: O<probe_circle_outside> call [Est Boss Dia] [Z Drop Dist] [Clearance from Edge] [Fast Feed])
#<boss_dia> = #1
#<z_drop> = #2
#<clearance> = #3
#<fast_feed> = #4
#<slow_feed> = [#<fast_feed> / 10.0]

#<rad_move> = [[#<boss_dia> / 2.0] + #<clearance>]

(Save starting WORK coordinates using correct LinuxCNC named parameters)
#<start_x> = #<_x>
#<start_y> = #<_y>
#<safe_z> = #<_z>

G40 G49

(--- PROBE X+ SIDE ---)
(Move to right side, drop Z, probe inward)
G90 G0 X[#<start_x> + #<rad_move>]
G91 G0 Z-[#<z_drop>]
G91 G38.2 X-[#<clearance> * 1.5] F#<fast_feed>
O101 if [#5070 EQ 0]
    (MSG, X+ Side Probe failed to hit wall!)
    G90
    M2
O101 endif
G91 G0 X1.0
G91 G38.2 X-2.0 F#<slow_feed>
#<x_plus_edge> = #5061
(Retract Z to safe height in WORK coords)
G90 G0 Z#<safe_z>

(--- PROBE X- SIDE ---)
(Move to left side, drop Z, probe inward)
G90 G0 X[#<start_x> - #<rad_move>]
G91 G0 Z-[#<z_drop>]
G91 G38.2 X[#<clearance> * 1.5] F#<fast_feed>
O102 if [#5070 EQ 0]
    (MSG, X- Side Probe failed to hit wall!)
    G90
    M2
O102 endif
G91 G0 X-1.0
G91 G38.2 X2.0 F#<slow_feed>
#<x_minus_edge> = #5061
(Retract Z to safe height)
G90 G0 Z#<safe_z>

(Calculate X Center in WORK coords)
#<center_x> = [[#<x_plus_edge> + #<x_minus_edge>] / 2.0]

(Move X to Center using WORK coords)
G90 G0 X#<center_x>

(--- PROBE Y+ SIDE ---)
(Move to back side, drop Z, probe inward. Note: X stays at true center)
G90 G0 Y[#<start_y> + #<rad_move>]
G91 G0 Z-[#<z_drop>]
G91 G38.2 Y-[#<clearance> * 1.5] F#<fast_feed>
O103 if [#5070 EQ 0]
    (MSG, Y+ Side Probe failed to hit wall!)
    G90
    M2
O103 endif
G91 G0 Y1.0
G91 G38.2 Y-2.0 F#<slow_feed>
#<y_plus_edge> = #5062
(Retract Z to safe height)
G90 G0 Z#<safe_z>

(--- PROBE Y- SIDE ---)
(Move to front side, drop Z, probe inward)
G90 G0 Y[#<start_y> - #<rad_move>]
G91 G0 Z-[#<z_drop>]
G91 G38.2 Y[#<clearance> * 1.5] F#<fast_feed>
O104 if [#5070 EQ 0]
    (MSG, Y- Side Probe failed to hit wall!)
    G90
    M2
O104 endif
G91 G0 Y-1.0
G91 G38.2 Y2.0 F#<slow_feed>
#<y_minus_edge> = #5062
(Retract Z to safe height)
G90 G0 Z#<safe_z>

(Calculate Y Center in WORK coords)
#<center_y> = [[#<y_plus_edge> + #<y_minus_edge>] / 2.0]

(Move Y to Center using WORK coords)
G90 G0 Y#<center_y>

(Now that probe is sitting at true physical center, set WCS!)
G10 L20 P0 X0 Y0

G90 (Return to absolute mode safely)
O<probe_circle_outside> endsub
M2